ct\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" at high zoom levels. If you are unsure whether the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point data in an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" is dense enough to warrant a heatmap,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can alternatively cluster the source using the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"option and render the data using an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNHeatmapStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can access an existing heatmap style layer using the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/layerWithIdentifier:"},{"type":"text","text":" method if you know its identifier;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"otherwise, find it using the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/layers"},{"type":"text","text":" property. You can also create a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"new heatmap style layer and add it to the style using a method such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addLayer:"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Related examp